{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1400940,\"title\":\"Clayface\",\"tagline\":\"Look fear in the face.\",\"overview\":\"Matt Hagen's meteoric rise from Gotham street kid to Hollywood leading man is tragically cut short when a local crime boss's actions leave him horribly disfigured. Abandoned by his team and with nothing left, Matt seeks out a cutting edge treatment that miraculously returns him to his former self… but also unexpectedly affects his grip on reality, spiraling him down a destructive path of all-consuming revenge.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9l1NuFjel2j89hiuiJbsxfblqjy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f1TVhqJJdxMvUsUDuKHS0ekgYkk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"voteCount\":468,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":109,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":44000000,\"revenue\":122421335,\"director\":\"James Watkins\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":63306,\"name\":\"James Watkins\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tZextIeFu04YIBBRjKOQuMyP2O9.jpg\"},{\"id\":1327945,\"name\":\"Tom Rhys Harries\",\"character\":\"Matt Hagen / Clayface\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/elxvpHPqOxGcKe6U2hcArIcpyWo.jpg\"},{\"id\":1537686,\"name\":\"Naomi Ackie\",\"character\":\"Caitlyn Corr\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dijwuTAEZUzQtoJfK49S4X80fQw.jpg\"},{\"id\":1665,\"name\":\"Eddie Marsan\",\"character\":\"Frank Fitzpatrick\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9atfOgIxhfOKvv2be8HEp6SzOct.jpg\"},{\"id\":2978,\"name\":\"Max Minghella\",\"character\":\"John Borrelli\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AhVDxsOOoAnwwVBL7ZY8W0mGsYJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":93236,\"name\":\"David Dencik\",\"character\":\"Markos Szabo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q5wLADc6yYd3owxSEG8VKbf7YWV.jpg\"},{\"id\":3286781,\"name\":\"Francesca Corney\",