 not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":170,\"title\":\"28 Days Later\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sQckQRt17VaWbo39GIu0TMOiszq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aJFwk1clMal1prxAvKAgHxKPAf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twenty-eight days after a killer virus was accidentally unleashed from a British research facility, a small group of London survivors are caught in a desperate struggle to protect themselves from the infected. Carried by animals and humans, the virus turns those it infects into homicidal maniacs -- and it's absolutely impossible to contain.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1084199,\"title\":\"Companion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oCoTgC3UyWGfyQ9thE10ulWR7bn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sc1abgWNXc29wSBaerrjGBih06l.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a weekend getaway at a secluded lakeside estate, a group of friends finds themselves entangled in a web of secrets, deception, and advanced technology. As tensions rise and loyalties are tested, they uncover unsettling truths about themselves and the world around them.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1064028,\"title\":\"Subservience\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gBenxR01Uy0Ev9RTIw6dVBPoyQU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/co7oxvpWxgd6FZU24DnljDDHYQA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With his wife out sick, a struggling father brings home a lifelike AI, only to have his self-aware new help want everything her new family has to offer... Like the affection of her owner and she'll kill to get it.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":520763,\"title\":\"A Quiet Place Part II\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4q2hz2m8hubgvijz8Ez0T2Os2Yv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uuBYYlbfiYD7ny5VNj46NG14ykR.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following the events at home, the Abbott family now face the terrors of the outside world. Forced to venture into the unknown, they realize that the creatures that hunt by sound are not the only threats that lurk beyond the sand path.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1307118,\"title\":\"Soulm8te\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aRfFP8stzodl0bo8ywoNZXdaVwo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7t6f6VxA2ZXbbZSVctgt7bZG2DI.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a ruthless tech giant acquires a small robotics company, a grieving engineer is tasked with testing their new AI companion. But when he attempts to reprogram her to be a truly sentient soulmate, she develops needs of her own—unleashing a relentless spree of precision-engineered mayhem.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":604079,\"title\":\"The Long Walk\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wobVTa99eW0ht6c1rNNzLkazPtR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jyghveaMeSnTMFKT2ZebfVymhET.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a dystopian America, fifty teenage boys take part in a deadly annual walking contest, forced to maintain a minimum pace or be executed, until only one survivor remains.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5876,\"title\":\"The Mist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c4UgUKZjM0Qzy5t4hAXSOFHYsnb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/76J14zgwVWyOciri7X7F3DGP3TA.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a violent storm, a dense cloud of mist envelops a small Maine town, trapping David Drayton and his five-year-old son in a local grocery store with other local residents. They soon discover that the mist conceals deadly horrors that threaten their lives, and worse, their sanity.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":158015,\"title\":\"The Purge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x6hwbnR2nGacSzljqYaXY25w1Me.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/anFRs7Xi7u2nqqBpmhqvXINAPix.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Given the country's overcrowded prisons, the U.S. government begins to allow 12-hour periods of time in which all illegal activity is legal. During one of these free-for-alls, a family must protect themselves from a home invasion.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":762504,\"title\":\"Nope\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AcKVlWaNVVVFQwro3nLXqPljcYA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yRutvYkM3OP8N9oqqfjSK1VC7fs.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Residents in a lonely gulch of inland California bear witness to an uncanny, chilling discovery.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1454682,\"title\":\"Monster Awakens\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zCC4GQrAkP2tc8Y9Ny0iZULbcty.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/H5Nz6j5aOPkmAXKVYRHkU6b3ro.jpg\",\"rating\":4.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young woman is caught in a blizzard deep in the woods of Maine. She faces extreme temperatures and is hunted by the predators of the woods. Her father attempts to find and save her from the bitter cold, and the monster that awaits them.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"f7jlCqdtwdM\",\"name\":\"The Plane\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"KC